jagger (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release, built as part of the Ubuntu 26.04 LTS /
    Debian 13.6.0 production-deployment modernization. Upstream (the
    Edugate/Jagger project) does not itself version-tag releases; this
    changelog and version number belong to the packaging in this fork,
    not to an upstream release.
  * See docs/AUDIT.md for the full list of what changed and why:
    dependency modernization (Doctrine, phpseclib, php-amqplib,
    cron-expression, CodeIgniter 3 now Composer-managed), a
    CodeIgniter 4 migration scaffold (docs/CI4_MIGRATION.md), a
    dedicated least-privilege 'jagger' system user, systemd units,
    PHP-FPM instead of mod_php, TLS 1.2/1.3-only Apache config, and
    randomly-generated secrets instead of shipped defaults.

 -- Jagger Maintainers <jagger-maintainers@example.org>  Fri, 21 Aug 2026 15:45:04 +0500
